<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Siderca Q3 net profit $63.93.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Siderca Q3 net profit $63.93.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter ended Dec 31</p>
<p>Net $63.93 million vs $17.94 million</p>
<p>Nine-months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>Net $150.84 million vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Domestic and foreign sales totalled 635,666 tonnes of steel tubes in the nine months to Dec 31, up from 558,133 in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
